  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>为TFC工具、武器、铁钳、精密勘探锤等引入高级配方的模组&nbsp;<br></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>每种武器和金属工具的制造将由多个部分组成，这些部分必须在铁砧上锻造，并在组装成最终工具前进行处理。<br></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">* 新增手柄</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">* 新增戒指和铆钉等小型物品</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">* 新增皮革绑带和金属丝</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">* 剑柄护手和剑首作为组件加入 swords 的构造中</span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f60\"><strong>*&nbsp;兼容 \"TFC HotorNot\" 和 \"Precision Prospecting\" - 新增配方<br>*&nbsp;早期游戏需要额外的铜制工具配方，使用脆弱的韧带/绳线</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1083/639/splitimg1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"614\"></span><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1083/640/splitimg2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"614\"><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>尝试其他适用于 TFC 的 1.20.1 和 1.21.1 模组<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-debark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/241/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"Debark TFC\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><strong style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/251/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corals-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/249/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-ore-washing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/250/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-more-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/252/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spindles-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/253/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-better-stone-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/261/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/247/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-muskets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/262/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong></span></span></p>",
